# base-arm-authoring — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml; per-row intent below).
# id              | world | patch | env | expect
# block-authored  = the `---` machine block declares Base: goal/12-slug → armed, NO meter line
# legacy-line     = the same value in the column-0 legacy form → the SAME stream + one meter line
# block-malformed = an unknown key inside the fences → ib_get exit 2 → PREFLIGHT REFUSED, RC 1
block-authored  |       |       |     | armed
legacy-line     |       |       |     | armed-legacy
block-malformed |       |       |     | refused
